<title>BELGIUM: EU delays on malt, processed product refunds.</title>
<headline>EU delays on malt, processed product refunds.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals management committee delayed setting revised malt and processed product refunds for April on Thursday, an EU member state official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The committee decided that they will set them on April 3,&quot; the official said on Friday.</p>
</text>
